      "transcript_text": "You'll be taking aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, seven days. You take it by mouth. That's for adult chickenpox. Stay at home until all the spots have crusted and stay away from pregnant women. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. If you become breathless or have chest pain, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department.",
